Subject: Threads seven frequent cold opcodes

What this does
  Threads seven frequent cold opcodes.

Why we need it
  

What it adds
  Adds dedicated handlers for argument application, constant-pool arithmetic, construction, local field access, local initialization and two transfer/store forms; regenerates the remaining cold arms.

Needs a bytecode version bump
  No.
